    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1075">

                <pb facs="0985" n="671" xml:id="pg671"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.741/13</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The German Chargé d’Affaires</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Haniel</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">German Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Newport, Rhode Island</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-15">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 15, 1914</hi>.</date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 2 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>In order that equal treatment might be reestablished, I beg to suggest that
                    censorship for wireless stations may be suspended while American Government has
                    the general question of censorship under consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Haniel</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
